---
layout: layout.njk
title: Tags
description: Browse poker game variants by tag — find games by mechanic, theme, or category.
permalink: /tags/
---

<h1>Browse by Tag</h1>

<p class="lead">Every tag used across the catalog. Select one to see the games it describes.</p>

{% set allTags = games | getAllTags %}

<p class="text-muted">{{ allTags.length }} tags across {{ games.length }} games.</p>

<div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3" role="list">
  {% for tag in allTags %}
  {% set count = (games | filterByTag(tag)).length %}
  <span role="listitem">
    {{ tag | clickableTag | safe }}
    <span class="text-muted small">({{ count }})</span>
  </span>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
